# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Repeating background tasks now start a few ticks apart after loading instead of all on the same tick, spreading out server load
- Improved server performance of Heavenly Aura (no longer reads player and pet data every few ticks)
- Cushion now reduces wall-crash damage by 20/40/60/80% per level (was 30/60/80/80%, so levels III and IV were identical)

## Fixes:
